## Validation Philosophy

Every artifact gets challenged. Every finding gets fixed. No cherry-picking.
Findings that add mechanism must state why a simpler change is
insufficient; findings that remove mechanism are applied with the same
directness (SKILL.md Rule 26).

**Planning artifacts** (brief, PRD, architecture, stories):
Party Mode --> Advanced Elicitation --> Adversarial Review (converge) -->
Apply all fixes --> Changelog

**Implementation artifacts** (code, tests):
Code Review (fix-and-re-review loops) --> QA (fix-and-revalidate loops) -->
Story Validation (remediate-and-rerun) --> Sprint-level adversarial +
party mode

